            <note corresp="#d1021-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1021-f2-content">
                <p>Reference to the memorandum of points attached to the U.S.-French Position Paper,
                    July 14, <ref target="#pg1363">p. 1363</ref>. This memorandum was also attached
                    to the Secretary’s instructions to Under Secretary Smith, July 16, <ref
                        target="#pg1389">p. 1389</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
